---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About | Bryan Huff"
	description="About Bryan Huff and his work in cybersecurity, infrastructure, and technical projects."
>
	<h1>About Me</h1>

	<p>
		I'm Bryan Huff, a cybersecurity student focused on developing practical
		experience alongside my formal education.
	</p>

	<p>
		I'm currently pursuing a B.S. in Cybersecurity and Information Assurance
		at Western Governors University. I also hold CompTIA A+, CompTIA Network+,
		and ITIL 4 Foundation certifications.
	</p>

	<h2>Hands-on learning</h2>

	<p>
		A large part of my learning takes place in my homelab, where I design,
		deploy, operate, and troubleshoot infrastructure rather than limiting my
		study to coursework and certification material.
	</p>

	<p>
		My current work includes network segmentation and firewalling with
		OPNsense, virtualization with Proxmox, containerized services, self-hosted
		Git infrastructure, storage and backup planning, and the documentation
		needed to operate those systems reliably.
	</p>

	<h2>Security and development</h2>

	<p>
		I'm also developing my offensive-security and programming skills through
		hands-on labs, cybersecurity exercises, Python projects, and security
		research.
	</p>

	<p>
		I'm particularly interested in understanding how systems are built,
		how they fail, and how both defensive and offensive security techniques
		apply to real infrastructure.
	</p>

	<h2>This site</h2>

	<p>
		I use this site to document projects, technical decisions, lessons
		learned, and areas I'm actively studying. Where appropriate, I also
		publish sanitized documentation and code from my homelab and other
		projects.
	</p>
</BaseLayout>
